<p dir="auto">Describes GenAI agent creation and is usually applicable when working with remote agent services.</p>
<p dir="auto">The <code>gen_ai.operation.name</code> SHOULD be <code>create_agent</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Span name</strong> SHOULD be <code>create_agent {gen_ai.agent.name}</code>.
Semantic conventions for individual GenAI systems and frameworks MAY specify different span name format.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Span kind</strong> SHOULD be <code>CLIENT</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Span status</strong> SHOULD follow the <a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions/blob/v1.44.0/docs/general/recording-errors.md">Recording Errors</a> document.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Requirement level:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions/blob/v1.44.0/docs/general/signal-requirement-level.md">Recommended</a>.</p>
