<code>read_skill_resource</code>;</li>
<li><a href="https://docs.agno.com/skills/overview" rel="nofollow">Agno</a>
<code>get_skill_reference</code> and <code>get_skill_script</code> when called with
<code>execute=false</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Span name</strong> SHOULD be
<code>execute_tool {gen_ai.tool.name} {gen_ai.skill.name} {gen_ai.skill.resource.name}</code>
when the skill and resource names are available,
<code>execute_tool {gen_ai.tool.name} {gen_ai.skill.resource.name}</code> when only the
resource name is available, and <code>execute_tool {gen_ai.tool.name}</code> otherwise.</p>
<p dir="auto">The skill name SHOULD NOT be appended by itself.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Span kind</strong> SHOULD be <code>INTERNAL</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Span status</strong> SHOULD follow the <a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions/blob/v1.44.0/docs/general/recording-errors.md">Recording Errors</a> document.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Requirement level:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/semantic-conventions/blob/v1.44.0/docs/general/signal-requirement-level.md">Recommended</a>.</p>
